    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a design spec for a law firm lobby in london. it's a high-traffic area so i need to compare polished concrete, luxury vinyl tile (lvt), and natural stone. can u give me a breakdown of how they hold up in terms of wear resistance and how much maintenance they'll need long term?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
