      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Polished concrete offers excellent durability and is very resistant to heavy foot traffic, requiring only periodic sealing to maintain its sheen. LVT is generally very resilient against wear and tear, often needing minimal upkeep, especially with quality commercial-grade options. Natural stone provides a high-end look but can be more susceptible to scratching or etching, necessitating regular sealing and occasional professional cleaning for long-term maintenance.",
